hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"139","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hum Tujhe un ki gardanon mein [un ke khilaf] dalte hain aur un ke sharon se teri panah chahte hain. [Dushman ke khauf par padhe]"
"140","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tu mera bazu aur madadgar hai; Tere sath hilta hun, Tere sath hamla karta hun, Tere sath ladta hun. [Dushman se muqable par padhe]"
"141","[AI-translation] Allah mujhe kafi hai; aur woh behtareen Wakeel hai. [Dushman ke muqable par padhe]"
